%% The life of one work item. Every transition is caused by a person - either
%% their own update, or a change they approved. The agent never moves an item.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> todo: imported from the tracker
  todo --> in_progress: owner starts work
  in_progress --> blocked: owner raises a blocker, or approves the proposal
  blocked --> in_progress: blocker cleared, resolvedDate stamped
  in_progress --> done: owner posts done
  blocked --> done: delivered despite the blocker
  in_progress --> overdue: past the due date, status not moved
  overdue --> in_progress: owner posts an update
  overdue --> done: delivered late
  done --> [*]

  [*] --> monitoring: a risk under watch
  monitoring --> resolved: mitigated
  resolved --> [*]

  [*] --> spillover: carried over from the last sprint
  spillover --> in_progress: picked up again

  note right of blocked
    Scoring while blocked: +30, plus 5 per day
    blocked (max +20). Everything that depends
    on it is flagged "cannot deliver", even if
    its own status still says in progress.
  end note

  note right of overdue
    A daily update is expected only for
    in_progress, blocked and spillover.
    Silence anywhere else is never nagged.
  end note
